From ERA5α (https://cds.climate.copernicus.eu/datasets/reanalysis-era5-single-levels?tab=download)
This data is used to visualize wind environment around Kabushima Island, Japan. 
Code6 need to be run by this wind data because need to use the same range of longitude/latitude throughout all years.

2013 year wind data：
time range： 2013-03-01 to 2013-09-30 23:00:00 
lon range： 141.1 to 144.1 
lat range： 39.5 to 42 

2014 year wind data：
time range： 2014-03-01 to 2014-09-30 23:00:00 
lon range： 141.1 to 144.1 
lat range： 39.5 to 42 

